 This is a configuration program for TransAmiga BBS. It uses MUI to do the 
GUI interface. MUI necessary objects were included together to make installation
easier. You'll need OS 2.04+ to run it!
 To use the program simply call it with your full path to the BBS master config
file or without any argument to create a config file called Transamiga.cfg in
the current directory.
 This is just the master configurator editor. If you want the full pack with the
message config,file config, bulletin config and user editor send US$ 15 payable
